    { "type": "text", "id": "arkonBody", "x": 80, "y": 1100, "width": 1060, "height": 44, "text": "the green Retrieval + Evidence + Compilation layers above ARE the Arkon-aligned substrate · object/evidence indexes · source trace · normalization · pipeline phases", "originalText": "the green Retrieval + Evidence + Compilation layers above ARE the Arkon-aligned substrate · object/evidence indexes · source trace · normalization · pipeline phases", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#5b21b6", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 500001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500002, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "dataRect", "x": 1190, "y": 360, "width": 384, "height": 256, "strokeColor": "#334155", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600002, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": { "type": 3 } },
    { "type": "text", "id": "dataTxt", "x": 1206, "y": 374, "width": 352, "height": 228, "text": "Command Center payload — what the UI consumes\nget_review_home_surface().to_dict()\n\n{\n  situation_frame { summary, primary_tension,\n    urgent_items, owner_gaps, surfaces[] },\n  priority_stack[4] { risk_type, urgency,\n    owner_state, primary_command, ... },\n  available_commands[7]\n}", "originalText": "Command Center payload — what the UI consumes\nget_review_home_surface().to_dict()\n\n{\n  situation_frame { summary, primary_tension,\n    urgent_items, owner_gaps, surfaces[] },\n  priority_stack[4] { risk_type, urgency,\n    owner_state, primary_command, ... },\n  available_commands[7]\n}", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#4ade80", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600004, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "gapRect", "x": 1190, "y": 660, "width": 384, "height": 200, "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600005, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600006, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": { "type": 3 } },
    { "type": "text", "id": "gapTxt", "x": 1206, "y": 676, "width": 352, "height": 168, "text": "⚠  Key gap\nThe domain kernel (blast-radius preview,\npublish actions, propagation) is NOT\nreachable through the tool contract.\nThe write path does not call it.\n\nNo persistence / approval-record store\nyet — approval = a channel-string check.", "originalText": "⚠  Key gap\nThe domain kernel (blast-radius preview,\npublish actions, propagation) is NOT\nreachable through the tool contract.\nThe write path does not call it.\n\nNo persistence / approval-record store\nyet — approval = a channel-string check.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#fca5a5", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600008, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "nextRect", "x": 1190, "y": 904, "width": 384, "height": 176, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600009, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600010, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": { "type": 3 } },
    { "type": "text", "id": "nextTxt", "x": 1206, "y": 920, "width": 352, "height": 144, "text": "Next high-leverage step\n① thin FastAPI over the green kernel\n② expose blast-radius + publish actions\n     as tools (close the write path)\n③ build Command Center UI on top\n④ then M4 graph + eval → unlocks E4", "originalText": "Next high-leverage step\n① thin FastAPI over the green kernel\n② expose blast-radius + publish actions\n     as tools (close the write path)\n③ build Command Center UI on top\n④ then M4 graph + eval → unlocks E4", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600011, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600012, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3 }
